credscope (0.2.3-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release (v0.2.3): release metadata and documentation
    refresh (VERSION, CHANGELOG.md, current-release references updated
    from v0.2.2 to v0.2.3). No functional CLI changes since v0.2.2.
  * Debian packaging itself is unchanged from 0.2.2-1: still builds from
    source against Debian-packaged Go libraries via dh-golang, with no
    vendor/ directory and no network access at build time. See
    debian/README.source for the full explanation.
  * Not yet submitted to Kali or Debian.

